OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells for most
OL,6,Fareas, a scattering of showers further
OL,7,Fwest and around the isles persisting
OL,8,Fthrough the day. Light winds and
OL,9,Ffeeling quite cool even in sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few showers lingering
OL,12,Fotherwise dry with clear spells,
OL,13,Ffeeling quite chilly. Turning cloudier
OL,14,Flater in the evening with rain
OL,15,Fspreading east later in the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FA wet start for most areas,
OL,18,Frain will be heavy and persistent for
OL,19,Fa time, turning lighter for western
OL,20,Fareas by lunchtime and likely a dry
OL,21,Fand bright afternoon here.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
