OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRather
OL,6,Funsettled over the weekend, rain and
OL,7,Fstrong winds spread east on Saturday.
OL,8,FShowery on Sunday but accompanied by
OL,9,Fgales. Perhaps a brighter morning
OL,10,FMonday, but further rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
